# The three-Oblivion-Ring loop with Bot2 holding Disenchant and two untapped Plains, as in
# oblivion-ring-loop-a-player-can-break-with-an-instant-is-not-a-draw - but Bot2 never casts it. Disenchant is no part of the
# loop, and no player can be made to take an action that would end a loop but those its objects call for (CR 732.5). The
# game comes back to the same position each time a Ring leaves, with every player only passing since: a loop of passes,
# which is let go round and is then a draw (docs/rules-exceptions.md, RX-4): the engine keeps the position in full the
# first time it comes round, and draws the game once it has come round three times more, each the same in full. After
# Bot2's twelfth pass the game is still going, as it is where Bot2 casts Disenchant in the other scenario; after its
# thirteenth the game is a draw, Disenchant still in Bot2's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Oblivion Ring
Oblivion Ring
Oblivion Ring
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Disenchant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivion Ring.Cast
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivion Ring.Cast
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivion Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Result = InProgress
? Bot2.Hand = Disenchant; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Result = Draw
DrawReason = MandatoryLoop
Turn = 9
Step = Main1
Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Plains
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains#1.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains#2.Tapped = false
Bot2.Hand = Disenchant; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Status = (absent)
Bot2.Status = (absent)
